==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Should you have all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3 by this point, this stage should be a cakewalk. Basic fodder units are likely able to clear this stage in spite of the Metal Doges that appear here.

